[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874027885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106319#issuecomment-2874027885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106319","id":2874027885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rTi9t","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-12T20:55:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T21:26:36Z","body":"This is awesome! I'm getting pretty substantial speed boosts in the physics demo (20fps without SIMD, 40fps with SIMD) on my laptop (arm64, safari).\r\n\r\nNotably, the \"Array copy\" demo demonstrates that enabling `SIMD` affects `memcpy` _sometimes_ - apparently, x64 ~windows~ Linux gets pretty major speed boosts, but arm64 mac doesn't (it probably already uses SIMD for `memcpy`). Still, this implies that at least for x64, we should get major performance improvements with this across the engine (e.g. for `memcpy`, but likely other parts as well).\r\n\r\nWe should think hard about whether we want to cut support for pre 2023 browsers, but people _do_ usually update, a